00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.556
"Haben Sie noch was zu sagen?" 

00:00:47.556 --> 00:00:48.056
"Nein." 

00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:49.278
"Er hat nichts zu sagen."

00:00:49.278 --> 00:00:51.278
"Arme Sau."

